WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.810
King Selfish is surrounded by an abundance of Egogy.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.380
His resurrection draws near, no?

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.290
It does, so I'm putting my plan in motion.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:12.660
Plan?

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.330
Take a look.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.930
If you remove one small part of this fan,

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:19.940
it all falls apart.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.430
Those Precures are the same way.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.370
Without Mana, they'll all fall apart.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.660
I see.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.410
You plan to draw Cure Heart away from her comrades.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:40.800
I'll crush anyone who tries to stop Daddy's resurrection.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.720
Why isn't it Christmas already?

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.260
She's even more excited than usual.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:54.140
Mana, you've always loved Christmas, huh?

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.640
Yeah!

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.940
When I was a kid, I wanted to be Santa Claus!

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.580
I'd give love to good boys and girls!

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:04.680
It would suit you.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:09.160
We're all going to see a parade, so I'm super excited!

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:09.950
Yeah!

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.930
Merry Christmas!

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.490
A bit early for it, though.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:17.230
Welly well well.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:20.140
I do believe you might beeeeee Aida Mana?

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:25.400
Aren't you, like, gonna join the Student Council President Speech Contest?

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:28.370
Student Council President Speech Contest?

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:30.100
You haven't heard?

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.820
It's, like, who's the most presidential of the student council presidents?

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:34.930
Like...

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:39.440
To deeeetermine a veritable King of Student Council Puuuuuresindents!

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.410
King of Student Council Presidents, you say?!

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:44.620
In that case...

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:47.310
I absolutely have to join!

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:48.030
{OP}

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:54.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:56.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:57.070 --> 00:01:59.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:01.600
Every day it sparkles

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:05.280
Dokidoki Precure

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:12.190
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:17.850
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:23.500
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:28.940
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:34.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:43.510
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.190
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:50.420
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.230
What's more than just cute

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:57.100
is our promise between girls

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:03.140
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:09.050
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:18.980
I've never heard of a contest to determine the King of Student Council Presidents.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:23.290
It says many Prime Ministers entered in their student years...

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:26.840
In that case, Mana can't refuse!

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.610
I'm so hyped!

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.960
Hey, it says it takes place on December 24th!

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.820
Huh? Christmas Eve?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:41.170
The time overlaps with the entire parade to boot!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.890
Aww...

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:45.410
Guess I can't enter the contest.

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:49.260
I think you should go.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:54.120
You want to be the King of Student Council Presidents.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.420
Certainly.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.120
But...

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:02.550
We can always hang out another time,

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.190
so go out and win it!

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:09.240
But I've got student council work I need to do over the break...

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.630
I'll find a way to finish it.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.410
Really?

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:14.320
Yeah.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.680
So go win that contest.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.200
Rikka!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.940
You're a lifesaver!

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:23.240
Here we go...

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:27.090
With Mana gone, we're gonna be busy.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.130
Rikka, are you sure you're okay with this?

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:34.750
I know you want to be with Mana on Christmas...

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.710
Well, a bit...

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:42.040
But soon, we'll enter high school, get careers,

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.760
and chase after our own dreams... {don't tell children this it's too ;_;}

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:49.710
We can't just stay together forever, right?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:55.180
Even if we're apart, we have our own lives to lead...

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:05.150
A Selfish Trap!

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:05.150
A Selfish Trap!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.060
Let's see...

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:10.690
This is all the paperwork you need finished, right?

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:11.250
Yeah!

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:16.860
All right, I'll knock this out before I meet up with the others!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:23.080
Rikka, won't Christmas be a bummer without me around?

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.080
Not at all.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:27.810
That bummed <i>me</i> out...

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:32.180
Look, I want you to become King of Presidents.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.780
So even if we're apart, I'll carry on!

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:37.680
Rikka...

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:42.430
All right, then I won't let you down!

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.730
diner

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.730
Pig's Tail

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.370
Punctual, punctual!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.330
Shall we not take our deeeeeparture?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.540
Like, move it or lose it!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.590
Okay!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.440
You student council members have a lot of work.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:06.150
I respect how much effort the president and Hishikawa put in.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.720
I just follow Mana's lead.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.720
We're helping out, too!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.000
Gotcha!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.730
Will Mana be all right?

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.400
I hope she doesn't flub her lines...

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:24.770
Can't stop thinking about Mana even when she's away, huh?

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.670
It's challed love!

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.410
Who said that?

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.380
J-Just the wind, I'm sure!

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:37.240
This is, like, totally the place!

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:40.010
Please enter, if you'd beeee so kind!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:41.920
Hello!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.810
Student Council President

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.810
Speech Contest

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.550
Yoohoo, Mana!

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:51.800
Regina!

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:55.590
Here's my Christmas present to you.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:02.940
What happened?!

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.980
Regina, what's this about?

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:09.810
Without you around, the rest of the Precures will be a cinch to beat.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.490
It'll be a piece of cake!

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:17.290
Your just deeeeeserts, wouldn't you say?

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.810
So it was you?

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.130
We got tricked!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:25.330
Oh no! We need to give this to the teachers by today!

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:26.200
Huh?

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:27.510
And this, too!

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.750
We've gotta get these done!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:30.940
What do we do?

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:32.300
All of those?

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.510
I'll make copies right away!

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:38.210
Now what?

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:40.340
We won't make the parade at this rate!

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.500
Who can we call for help?

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:47.740
Hey Rikka, look at this.

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:47.780
Mana's

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:47.800
Memo

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:47.800
\h\hRikka, when it gets 
\hsuper, duper busy, just 
take a deep breath 
and relax! Don't worry. 
You can do it!

